    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59608" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραμβᾰλίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπυρίζω, κατασείω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραμβᾰλιαστύς</span></b> , ἡ, <i>loud
				laughter</i> (to be read for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαραμβαλιαστύς</span>), Id. (post <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρᾷν</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραμβασπάρᾰγος</span></b> , ὁ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραμβοσπάραγον</span>
			, <u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
